<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O anxious soul, lay down thy load,</l><l>Oh, hear His voice, He speaks to thee,</l><l>“Be still and know that I am God,</l><l>And cast thy every care on Me.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O fearful soul, be still, be still,</l><l>Be of good cheer; has He not said,</l><l>“I will be with you, fear no ill,</l><l>’Tis I, ’tis I, be not afraid“?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O praying soul, be still, be still,</l><l>He cannot break His plighted word;</l><l>Sink down into His blessed will,</l><l>And wait in patience on the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O waiting soul, be still, be strong,</l><l>And though He tarry, trust and wait;</l><l>Doubt not, He will not wait too long,</l><l>Fear not, He will not come too late.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
